[839.05556,"o","\u001b[0m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Match the shared-link timers\r\n  ============================\r\n\r\n  frr0 is a broadcast link. Ze and FRR must agree on area and Hello/dead\r\n  timers to form an adjacency: here Hello is 10 seconds, dead is 40.\r\n\r\n  FRR calls the setting ip ospf hello-interval 10. Ze places\r\n  hello-interval 10 under ospf interfaces interface frr0.\r\n  The cost is the local SPF cost of this link.\r\n"]
