[923.665684,"o","\u001b[0m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Introduce a Hello mismatch\r\n  ==========================\r\n\r\n  Change only Ze's Hello interval from 10 to 20 seconds.\r\n  FRR keeps sending Hello interval 10. The mismatch rejects those\r\n  Hellos rather than silently accepting incompatible timers.\r\n\r\n  This is a live SSH commit on the same router, not a different lab.\r\n"]
